# Issue #19: a service the stack file declares with `replicas: 0`, which an
# external scheduler (swarm-cronjob) has since scaled to a target of 1.
#
# Fifth field is the spec replicas, i.e. what the stack file asks for. It
# diverges from the target in the replicas field here on purpose: that
# divergence is the bug, and reading the spec is what resolves it.
svc_dbpack|demo_dbpack|deployed|0/1|0
svc_backend|demo_backend|deployed|1/1
